      "start_line": 138,
      "text": "  rule primeTail(N:Int, D:Int) => primeTail(N, D -Int 1)\n    requires D >Int 2\n      andBool D <=Int N\n      andBool pyMod(N, D -Int 1) =/=Int 0\n    [symbolic(N, D), simplification]"
