      "start_line": 174,
      "text": "  rule pyMod(N:Int, 10)\n       +Int digitSum((N -Int pyMod(N, 10)) /Int 10)\n    => digitSum(N)\n    requires N >Int 0\n    [symbolic(N), simplification]"
